      "name": "semantic_get",
      "content": "{\"ok\": true, \"entities\": [{\"id\": \"FCLT_BUILDING\", \"name\": \"FCLT_BUILDING\", \"desc\": \"Facilities building inventory table: one row per physical building with building number/name, type (e.g. ACADEMIC), ownership, use, occupancy class, gross/assignable/non-assignable areas, number of rooms, key dates (built/acquired/occupied), site and geographic coordinates. Parent of FCLT_ROOMS via FCLT_BUILDING_KEY.\", \"columns\": {\"FCLT_BUILDING_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the building; joins to FCLT_ROOMS.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY\"}, \"BUILDING_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Building number/code, e.g. '32', 'E38'; same value as FCLT_BUILDING_KEY in current data; can be matched to FCLT_BUILDING_ADDRESS.BUILDING_NUMBER\"}, \"PARENT_BUILDING_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Parent building number\"}, \"PARENT_BUILDING_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Parent building name\"}, \"PARENT_BUILDING_NAME_LONG\": {\"desc\": \"Long parent building name\"}, \"BUILDING_NAME_LONG\": {\"desc\": \"Long building name, e.g. 'Stanley Gordon Brown Building'; fuller naming variant of BUILDING_NAME\"}, \"EXT_GROSS_AREA\": {\"desc\": \"Extended gross area of the building in square meters\"}, \"ASSIGNABLE_AREA\": {\"desc\": \"Total assignable area of the building in square meters\"}, \"NON_ASSIGNABLE_AREA\": {\"desc\": \"Non-assignable area of the building in square meters\"}, \"SITE\": {\"desc\": \"Site/campus the building belongs to, e.g. 'MIT', 'BATES', 'LINC', 'BOS'; 'MIT' filters buildings on the MIT campus\"}, \"CAMPUS_SECTOR\": {\"desc\": \"Campus sector the building is in, e.g. 'MAIN GROUP', 'EAST', 'NORTHWEST', 'WEST', 'OFFCAMPUS'\"}, \"ACCESS_LEVEL_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Numeric access level code of the building (observed values 0-2); distinct from FCLT_ROOMS.ACCESS_LEVEL (per-room) and FCLT_FLOOR.ACCESS_LEVEL (per-floor)\"}, \"ACCESS_LEVEL_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Access level name of the building (same numeric value as ACCESS_LEVEL_CODE in current data)\"}, \"BUILDING_TYPE\": {\"desc\": \"Building type classification: 'ACADEMIC' (academic buildings), 'SERVICE', or 'RESIDENT' (residential buildings); used to filter academic/residential buildings\"}, \"OWNERSHIP_TYPE\": {\"desc\": \"Ownership type: 'OWNED' or 'LEASED'\"}, \"BUILDING_USE\": {\"desc\": \"Primary use code of the building, e.g. 'AER', 'DHOA', 'STAC', 'GAR', 'OTH'; may be null\"}, \"OCCUPANCY_CLASS\": {\"desc\": \"Occupancy classification code of the building (e.g. 'UGB', 'UGA3', 'UGR2'); coded combinations of use/grade/occupancy attributes\"}, \"BUILDING_HEIGHT\": {\"desc\": \"Height of the building (numeric, in feet); used in height filters and averages\"}, \"COST_CENTER_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Cost center code of the building, e.g. '1810200'; alternative join key to FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.COST_CENTER_CODE; null for some buildings\"}, \"COST_COLLECTOR_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Cost collector key of the building (same value as COST_CENTER_CODE in current data); alternative join key to FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.COST_COLLECTOR_KEY used to count historical records per building\"}, \"LATITUDE_WGS\": {\"desc\": \"Latitude (WGS)\"}, \"LONGITUDE_WGS\": {\"desc\": \"Longitude (WGS)\"}, \"EASTING_X_SPCS\": {\"desc\": \"Easting coordinate (SPCS)\"}, \"NORTHING_Y_SPCS\": {\"desc\": \"Northing coordinate (SPCS)\"}, \"BUILDING_SORT\": {\"desc\": \"Sortable building name\"}, \"BUILDING_NAMED_FOR\": {\"desc\": \"Person the building is named for\"}, \"BUILDING_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Building name, e.g. 'Ray and Maria Stata Center', 'BROWN BUILDING'; used for building-level grouping and name filters (values are uppercase for some buildings)\"}, \"DATE_BUILT\": {\"desc\": \"Date the building was built, stored in MM/DD/YYYY format (FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1 variant uses DD-MON-YY); the year built is derived from this column\"}, \"DATE_ACQUIRED\": {\"desc\": \"Date the building was acquired, MM/DD/YYYY format; often null\"}, \"DATE_OCCUPIED\": {\"desc\": \"Date the building was first occupied, MM/DD/YYYY format\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}, \"NUM_OF_ROOMS\": {\"desc\": \"Current number of rooms in the building; distinct from FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.NUM_OF_ROOMS which is the per-fiscal-period historical value\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per building\"}, {\"id\": \"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST\", \"name\": \"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST\", \"desc\": \"Historical facilities building snapshot table: one row per building per fiscal period (FISCAL_PERIOD in YYYYMM format, covering 201505-201906, 48 periods, ~255 buildings), preserving each building's attributes over time: identifiers and names, gross/assignable/non-assignable areas, site, campus sector, access level, building type, ownership type, use, occupancy class, height, cost center/collector references, coordinates, and number of rooms. Used for fiscal-period building history analysis (area/room-count trends, dispersion statistics across historical records); use FCLT_BUILDING for the current snapshot. Date columns (DATE_BUILT/DATE_ACQUIRED/DATE_OCCUPIED) are stored in MM/DD/YYYY format; FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1 is the variant storing them in DD-MON-YY format.\", \"columns\": {\"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the historical building record, formatted as '<building key>-<fiscal period>' (e.g. '46-201505')\"}, \"FISCAL_PERIOD\": {\"desc\": \"Fiscal period of the snapshot in YYYYMM format (e.g. 201505); the time dimension of the history, covering 201505-201906\"}, \"FCLT_BUILDING_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Building identifier key (building number/code, e.g. '32'); joins to FCLT_BUILDING.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY and FCLT_ROOMS.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY\"}, \"BUILDING_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Building number as recorded in the fiscal period\"}, \"PARENT_BUILDING_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Parent building number in the fiscal period\"}, \"PARENT_BUILDING_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Parent building name in the fiscal period\"}, \"PARENT_BUILDING_NAME_LONG\": {\"desc\": \"Long parent building name in the fiscal period\"}, \"BUILDING_NAME_LONG\": {\"desc\": \"Long building name in the fiscal period; used to identify buildings (e.g. academic buildings at MIT) in history-based queries\"}, \"EXT_GROSS_AREA\": {\"desc\": \"Extended gross area of the building in square meters at the fiscal period\"}, \"ASSIGNABLE_AREA\": {\"desc\": \"Assignable area of the building in square meters at the fiscal period; used in historical area statistics (sum, average, min, stddev)\"}, \"NON_ASSIGNABLE_AREA\": {\"desc\": \"Non-assignable area of the building in square meters at the fiscal period\"}, \"SITE\": {\"desc\": \"Site of the building at the fiscal period, e.g. 'MIT'; historical counterpart of FCLT_BUILDING.SITE\"}, \"CAMPUS_SECTOR\": {\"desc\": \"Campus sector at the fiscal period, e.g. 'MAIN GROUP', 'EAST', 'NORTHWEST', 'OFFCAMPUS'\"}, \"ACCESS_LEVEL_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Numeric access level code of the building at the fiscal period (observed values 0-2); joins to FCLT_BUILDING.ACCESS_LEVEL_CODE\"}, \"ACCESS_LEVEL_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Access level name at the fiscal period (same numeric value as the code in current data)\"}, \"BUILDING_TYPE\": {\"desc\": \"Building type at the fiscal period: 'ACADEMIC', 'SERVICE', or 'RESIDENT'; historical counterpart of FCLT_BUILDING.BUILDING_TYPE\"}, \"OWNERSHIP_TYPE\": {\"desc\": \"Ownership type at the fiscal period: 'OWNED' or 'LEASED'\"}, \"BUILDING_USE\": {\"desc\": \"Primary use of the building at the fiscal period\"}, \"OCCUPANCY_CLASS\": {\"desc\": \"Occupancy classification at the fiscal period\"}, \"BUILDING_HEIGHT\": {\"desc\": \"Building height at the fiscal period (stored as string)\"}, \"COST_CENTER_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Cost center code at the fiscal period; alternative join key to FCLT_BUILDING.COST_CENTER_CODE\"}, \"COST_COLLECTOR_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Cost collector key at the fiscal period; alternative join key to FCLT_BUILDING.COST_COLLECTOR_KEY, used to count historical records per building\"}, \"LATITUDE_WGS\": {\"desc\": \"Latitude (WGS) at the fiscal period\"}, \"LONGITUDE_WGS\": {\"desc\": \"Longitude (WGS) at the fiscal period\"}, \"EASTING_X_SPCS\": {\"desc\": \"Easting coordinate (SPCS) at the fiscal period\"}, \"NORTHING_Y_SPCS\": {\"desc\": \"Northing coordinate (SPCS) at the fiscal period\"}, \"BUILDING_SORT\": {\"desc\": \"Sortable building name at the fiscal period\"}, \"BUILDING_NAMED_FOR\": {\"desc\": \"Person the building is named for, at the fiscal period\"}, \"BUILDING_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Building name at the fiscal period, e.g. 'Ray and Maria Stata Center'; grouping/join key in history-based building queries\"}, \"DATE_BUILT\": {\"desc\": \"Date the building was built, stored in MM/DD/YYYY format (FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1 stores DD-MON-YY)\"}, \"DATE_ACQUIRED\": {\"desc\": \"Date the building was acquired, stored in MM/DD/YYYY format; often null\"}, \"DATE_OCCUPIED\": {\"desc\": \"Date the building was first occupied, stored in MM/DD/YYYY format\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}, \"NUM_OF_ROOMS\": {\"desc\": \"Number of rooms in the building at the fiscal period; historical counterpart of FCLT_BUILDING.NUM_OF_ROOMS, used in room-count statistics over building history records\"}, \"default_granularity\": null}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per building per fiscal period\"}, {\"id\": \"FCLT_ROOMS\", \"name\": \"FCLT_ROOMS\", \"desc\": \"Facilities room inventory table: one row per physical room with building/floor keys, room identifiers, use classifications (major/minor use), organization assignment, area in square meters, access level, and geographic coordinates. Joins to FCLT_BUILDING via FCLT_BUILDING_KEY; referenced by COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.MEET_PLACE via FCLT_ROOM_KEY.\", \"columns\": {\"FCLT_ROOM_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the room; joins to COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.MEET_PLACE for class-meeting location analysis\"}, \"BUILDING_ROOM\": {\"desc\": \"Combined building-room identifier\"}, \"FCLT_BUILDING_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Building identifier key of the room, storing the building number/code itself (e.g. 'E38', '14N'); can be filtered directly for a building or joined to FCLT_BUILDING.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY for building attributes\"}, \"FLOOR\": {\"desc\": \"Floor the room is on\"}, \"FCLT_FLOOR_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Foreign key to FCLT_FLOOR\"}, \"ROOM\": {\"desc\": \"Room number/name\"}, \"SPACE_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Space identifier\"}, \"FCLT_MAJOR_USE_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Major use key of the room; joins to FCLT_MAJOR_USE.FCLT_MAJOR_USE_KEY to decode the major use code/description and assignable flag\"}, \"MAJOR_USE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Major use description, e.g. classroom\"}, \"FCLT_USE_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"\"}, \"USE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Use description of the room\"}, \"FCLT_MINOR_USE_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Minor use key of the room\"}, \"MINOR_USE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Minor use description\"}, \"FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Organization key of the room\"}, \"ORGANIZATION_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Organization name occupying the room\"}, \"FCLT_MINOR_ORGANIZATION_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Minor organization key of the room\"}, \"MINOR_ORGANIZATION\": {\"desc\": \"Minor organization name\"}, \"AREA\": {\"desc\": \"Room area in square meters; used in area statistics (average, range, variance)\"}, \"ROOM_FULL_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Full room name\"}, \"DEPT_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Department code assigned to the room\"}, \"ACCESS_LEVEL\": {\"desc\": \"Numeric access level code of the room (observed values 0-3); used to filter rooms by access restriction level, e.g. ACCESS_LEVEL = 1\"}, \"LATITUDE_WGS\": {\"desc\": \"Latitude (WGS)\"}, \"LONGITUDE_WGS\": {\"desc\": \"Longitude (WGS)\"}, \"NORTHING_SPCS\": {\"desc\": \"Northing coordinate (SPCS)\"}, \"EASTING_SPCS\": {\"desc\": \"Easting coordinate (SPCS)\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per room\"}, {\"id\": \"column_concept_assignable_area\", \"name\": \"Assignable Area Measures\", \"desc\": \"Assignable-area measure columns at different granularity levels and time semantics: building-level current and per-fiscal-period assignable area, floor-level assignable area, and the space-domain assignable square footage. All FCLT_*/FAC_* columns are in square meters; BUILDINGS.BLDG_ASSIGNABLE_SQUARE_FOOTAGE is in square feet. Choosing the right column determines whether the measure is a building total, a floor total, a historical value, or a space-assignment figure.\", \"columns\": [\"FCLT_BUILDING.ASSIGNABLE_AREA\", \"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.ASSIGNABLE_AREA\", \"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1.ASSIGNABLE_AREA\", \"FCLT_FLOOR.ASSIGNABLE_AREA\", \"FCLT_FLOOR_HIST.ASSIGNABLE_AREA\", \"FAC_BUILDING.ASSIGNABLE_AREA\", \"FAC_FLOOR.ASSIGNABLE_AREA\", \"BUILDINGS.BLDG_ASSIGNABLE_SQUARE_FOOTAGE\"], \"comparisons\": [{\"dimension\": \"Granularity\", \"differences\": \"Building columns give one assignable-area total per building (per fiscal period for history); floor columns give the assignable area of each floor; summing floor assignable areas per building approximates but may not equal the building-level value.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Time semantics\", \"differences\": \"FCLT_BUILDING/FAC_BUILDING are current values; FCLT_BUILDING_HIST(_1) and FCLT_FLOOR_HIST carry per-fiscal-period values used for stddev/variance/sum across history records.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Units\", \"differences\": \"All FCLT_*/FAC_* assignable-area columns are square meters; BUILDINGS.BLDG_ASSIGNABLE_SQUARE_FOOTAGE is square feet.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Companion measures\", \"differences\": \"Each table pairs ASSIGNABLE_AREA with NON_ASSIGNABLE_AREA and EXT_GROSS_AREA at the same granularity, so assignable/non-assignable comparisons must stay within one table.\"}], \"decision_guide\": {\"Total assignable area of a building (current)\": \"Use FCLT_BUILDING.ASSIGNABLE_AREA.\", \"Assignable area statistics across a building's history records (stddev, sum, min over fiscal periods)\": \"Use FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.ASSIGNABLE_AREA.\", \"Assignable area of each floor, or floor-level thresholds (e.g. floors with assignable area above a value)\": \"Use FCLT_FLOOR.ASSIGNABLE_AREA joined to FCLT_BUILDING via FCLT_BUILDING_KEY.\", \"Assignable square footage for space-assignment reporting\": \"Use BUILDINGS.BLDG_ASSIGNABLE_SQUARE_FOOTAGE, keeping in mind it is in square feet.\"}}, {\"id\": \"column_concept_fiscal_period\", \"name\": \"Fiscal Period Code\", \"desc\": \"Fiscal period code columns in YYYYMM format (e.g. '199602' = FY1996 period 2, '201505') appearing in two distinct roles: as the primary key of the month-grain time dimension (TIME_MONTH.FISCAL_PERIOD, also mirrored in TIME_DAY.FISCAL_PERIOD for day-to-month linkage), and as the snapshot-period stamp of the facilities historical tables (FCLT_BUILDING_HIST, FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1, FCLT_BUILDING_ADDRESS_HIST, FCLT_FLOOR_HIST, FCLT_ROOMS_HIST, FCLT_MAJOR_USE_HIST). Both roles share the same YYYYMM value domain, but the time dimension uses it for calendar grouping while the history tables use it to mark when a facilities snapshot was taken.\", \"columns\": [\"TIME_MONTH.FISCAL_PERIOD\", \"TIME_DAY.FISCAL_PERIOD\", \"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.FISCAL_PERIOD\", \"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1.FISCAL_PERIOD\", \"FCLT_BUILDING_ADDRESS_HIST.FISCAL_PERIOD\", \"FCLT_FLOOR_HIST.FISCAL_PERIOD\", \"FCLT_ROOMS_HIST.FISCAL_PERIOD\", \"FCLT_MAJOR_USE_HIST.FISCAL_PERIOD\"], \"comparisons\": [{\"dimension\": \"Role\", \"detail\": \"In TIME_MONTH it identifies the month record itself (one row per period); in TIME_DAY it attributes each calendar day to its fiscal month and is the join key to TIME_MONTH; in FCLT_*_HIST tables it stamps the fiscal period at which the facilities snapshot (building/floor/room/address/classification) was recorded.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Coverage\", \"detail\": \"TIME_MONTH covers fiscal periods 199601-203516 (640 periods); TIME_DAY's fiscal periods overlap TIME_MONTH on 480 periods; the facilities history tables currently cover only period 201505 (FCLT_ROOMS_HIST, FCLT_MAJOR_USE_HIST), 201505-201602 (FCLT_FLOOR_HIST), or 201505-201906 (FCLT_BUILDING_HIST, FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1).\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Join behavior\", \"detail\": \"TIME_DAY.FISCAL_PERIOD = TIME_MONTH.FISCAL_PERIOD fans out one month row to all its days; joining history-table FISCAL_PERIOD values to TIME_MONTH resolves the snapshot period's calendar attributes but only matches within the overlapping period range.\"}], \"decision_guide\": {\"Month-level fiscal statistics or rolling days up to fiscal months\": \"Join TIME_DAY.FISCAL_PERIOD to TIME_MONTH.FISCAL_PERIOD.\", \"Historical facilities snapshots per fiscal period (area/room-count trends)\": \"Use the FCLT_*_HIST table's own FISCAL_PERIOD as the snapshot stamp; join to TIME_MONTH only when the snapshot period's calendar attributes are needed.\", \"Filtering records of a specific fiscal month\": \"Apply the YYYYMM filter on the FISCAL_PERIOD column of whichever table carries the grain required (day, month, or history snapshot).\"}}, {\"id\": \"column_concept_building_type_site\", \"name\": \"Building Type and Site Classification\", \"desc\": \"Building classification columns replicated across the current and historical building tables of both table families: BUILDING_TYPE ('ACADEMIC', 'SERVICE', 'RESIDENT') and SITE ('MIT', 'BATES', 'LINC', 'BOS', etc.). They carry the same value domain but differ in time semantics: the building-table columns are the current classification, while the history-table columns are the classification recorded at each fiscal period, so filtering by one versus the other can select different building sets.\", \"columns\": [\"FCLT_BUILDING.BUILDING_TYPE\", \"FCLT_BUILDING.SITE\", \"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.BUILDING_TYPE\", \"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.SITE\", \"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1.BUILDING_TYPE\", \"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1.SITE\", \"FAC_BUILDING.BUILDING_TYPE\", \"FAC_BUILDING.SITE\"], \"comparisons\": [{\"dimension\": \"Time semantics\", \"differences\": \"FCLT_BUILDING/FAC_BUILDING columns hold the current classification (one value per building); FCLT_BUILDING_HIST(_1) columns hold the classification per fiscal period, so a building can appear with different types/sites across its history rows.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Row multiplicity when filtering\", \"differences\": \"Filtering on the history columns multiplies result rows by the number of fiscal periods per building; filtering on the building-table columns keeps one row per building.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Table family\", \"differences\": \"FCLT_* columns join the FCLT_* family via FCLT_BUILDING_KEY; FAC_BUILDING columns join the FAC_* family via FAC_BUILDING_KEY.\"}], \"decision_guide\": {\"Questions about current academic/residential buildings or buildings at a site (e.g. 'academic buildings at MIT')\": \"Prefer FCLT_BUILDING.BUILDING_TYPE and FCLT_BUILDING.SITE: one row per building, no period duplication.\", \"Questions explicitly referencing building history records or per-fiscal-period classification (e.g. 'buildings that were academic in the history', history-based room counts)\": \"Use FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.BUILDING_TYPE / FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.SITE so the filter applies to each historical record.\", \"Same classification questions inside the FAC_* family\": \"Use FAC_BUILDING.BUILDING_TYPE / FAC_BUILDING.SITE.\"}}, {\"id\": \"concept_building_inventory\", \"name\": \"Building Inventory\", \"desc\": \"Tables recording the physical building inventory and its attributes (number/name, type, ownership, site, campus sector, access level, gross/assignable/non-assignable areas, number of rooms, key dates): the current FCLT_* family snapshot, its fiscal-period history (in two date-format variants), the FAC_* family snapshot, and the lightweight space-domain building lookup. They jointly answer questions about building characteristics, areas, and room counts, but differ in time coverage, table family, attribute richness, and area units.\", \"tables\": [\"FCLT_BUILDING\", \"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST\", \"FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1\", \"FAC_BUILDING\", \"BUILDINGS\"], \"comparisons\": [{\"dimension\": \"Time coverage\", \"differences\": \"FCLT_BUILDING, FAC_BUILDING, and BUILDINGS are current snapshots (one row per building); FCLT_BUILDING_HIST and FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1 carry one row per building per fiscal period (201505-201906, ~48 periods), enabling trend and dispersion statistics (stddev/variance of assignable area, room counts) across historical records.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Table family and join paths\", \"differences\": \"FCLT_BUILDING/FCLT_BUILDING_HIST join the FCLT_* family (FCLT_ROOMS, FCLT_FLOOR, FCLT_BUILDING_ADDRESS via FCLT_BUILDING_KEY); FAC_BUILDING joins the FAC_* family (FAC_ROOMS, FAC_FLOOR, FAC_BUILDING_ADDRESS via FAC_BUILDING_KEY); BUILDINGS joins the space domain (SPACE_DETAIL via BUILDING_KEY). FCLT_BUILDING_KEY, FAC_BUILDING_KEY, and BUILDINGS.BUILDING_KEY share the same building-number value domain.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Attribute richness\", \"differences\": \"FCLT_BUILDING, FCLT_BUILDING_HIST, FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1, and FAC_BUILDING carry full classification attributes (BUILDING_TYPE ACADEMIC/SERVICE/RESIDENT, OWNERSHIP_TYPE OWNED/LEASED, SITE, CAMPUS_SECTOR, ACCESS_LEVEL_CODE, OCCUPANCY_CLASS, BUILDING_HEIGHT, DATE_BUILT); BUILDINGS only carries key/number, name, single-text street and mailing addresses, and square-footage measures.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Area units\", \"differences\": \"FCLT_*/FAC_* building tables measure EXT_GROSS_AREA/ASSIGNABLE_AREA/NON_ASSIGNABLE_AREA in square meters; BUILDINGS measures BLDG_GROSS_SQUARE_FOOTAGE/BLDG_ASSIGNABLE_SQUARE_FOOTAGE in square feet. Unit choice matters for area thresholds and averages.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Date column formats\", \"differences\": \"FCLT_BUILDING and FCLT_BUILDING_HIST store DATE_BUILT/DATE_ACQUIRED/DATE_OCCUPIED as MM/DD/YYYY strings; FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1 is identical to FCLT_BUILDING_HIST except these dates are stored as DD-MON-YY strings (e.g. '25-APR-03').\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Alternative join keys to history\", \"differences\": \"FCLT_BUILDING joins FCLT_BUILDING_HIST primarily on FCLT_BUILDING_KEY, but COST_CENTER_CODE and COST_COLLECTOR_KEY are also valid join keys (used when counting historical records per cost collector); ACCESS_LEVEL_CODE joins associate buildings sharing the same access level with history attributes.\"}], \"decision_guide\": {\"Current building attributes, type/site/ownership filters, or current area and room-count values\": \"Use FCLT_BUILDING: the current FCLT_* family snapshot with full classification attributes and square-meter areas.\", \"Historical trends, per-fiscal-period values, or dispersion statistics (stddev/variance/count) across a building's history records\": \"Use FCLT_BUILDING_HIST: one row per building per fiscal period; count its rows for 'number of historical records' and aggregate ASSIGNABLE_AREA/NUM_OF_ROOMS across periods.\", \"Building history where dates must appear in DD-MON-YY format\": \"Use FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1: identical to FCLT_BUILDING_HIST except DATE_BUILT/DATE_ACQUIRED/DATE_OCCUPIED formatting.\", \"Building analysis that must stay inside the FAC_* key family (FAC_ROOMS/FAC_FLOOR/FAC_ORGANIZATION)\": \"Use FAC_BUILDING: mirrors FCLT_BUILDING attributes but joins via FAC_BUILDING_KEY.\", \"Building name/address text and square-footage measures for space-assignment reporting\": \"Use BUILDINGS: the space-domain lookup referenced by SPACE_DETAIL via BUILDING_KEY, with square-footage (not square-meter) measures.\"}}], \"not_found\": []}"
