lumn_concepts → building_type_site, assignable_area, num_of_rooms, access_level.\n- FCLT_BUILDING_HIST metrics_by_table: 10 metrics (listed above), all in \"Facility Space Analysis\" — confirming its business role as the fiscal-period building history source.\n- Hint join keys match the graph edges exactly: FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY ↔ FCLT_ROOMS.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY ↔ FCLT_BUILDING.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY.\n\n### 3. Similar-Entity Differences\n\n**3a. Dimension matrix (evidence-cited):**\n\n| Dimension | FCLT_BUILDING | FCLT_BUILDING_HIST | FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1 | FAC_BUILDING | BUILDINGS |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Granularity | one row per building (desc) | one row per building per fiscal period (desc) | same as HIST (desc) | one row per building (desc) | one row per building (desc) |\n| Time coverage | current snapshot | 201505–201906, 48 periods | same | current | current |\n| Key family | FCLT_BUILDING_KEY | FCLT_BUILDING_KEY | FCLT_BUILDING_KEY | FAC_BUILDING_KEY | BUILDING_KEY (space domain) |\n| Classification attrs | BUILDING_TYPE/SITE/OWNERSHIP_TYPE/CAMPUS_SECTOR (columns) | same, per period (columns) | same | same | none (concept comparison: \"without the type/ownership/site classification\") |\n| Area units | m² (columns) | m² (columns) | m² | m² | square feet (concept comparison) |\n| Fan-out risk | none (1 row/building) | ×48 periods per building | same | n/a | n/a |\n| Date format | MM/DD/YYYY | MM/DD/YYYY | DD-MON-YY (only difference, desc) | MM/DD/YYYY | n/a |\n\nRoom sources: FCLT_ROOMS (current, m², MAJOR_USE_DESC, joins FCLT_BUILDING via FCLT_BUILDING_KEY — column defs) vs FCLT_ROOMS_HIST (only period 201505 — desc) vs FAC_ROOMS (FAC_* keys) vs SPACE_DETAIL (square footage, space-usage text, no MAJOR_USE_DESC).\n\n**3b. Task-Requirement Fitness Mapping:**\n\n| Atomic requirement | FCLT_BUILDING | FCLT_BUILDING_HIST | FCLT_ROOMS | FCLT_ROOMS_HIST | FAC_*/BUILDINGS |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| BUILDING_TYPE='ACADEMIC', SITE='MIT', OWNERSHIP_TYPE='OWNED', key<>'32' filters | SUPPORTED (columns exist; hint maps filters here) | SUPPORTED but multiplies rows / wrong time semantics for \"current classification\" per column_concept_building_type_site guide | n/a | n/a | NOT-SUPPORTED (BUILDINGS lacks classification; FAC_* wrong key family per hint join keys) |\n| BUILDING_NAME output | SUPPORTED | SUPPORTED (per-period name) | NOT-SUPPORTED | NOT-SUPPORTED | partial |\n| FISCAL_PERIOD output (\"for each fiscal period\") | NOT-SUPPORTED (no such column) | SUPPORTED (only source of fiscal period in gold tables) | NOT-SUPPORTED | SUPPORTED but coverage only 201505 → VIOLATES \"each fiscal period\" | NOT-SUPPORTED |\n| Total room area for MAJOR_USE_DESC IN ('RESIDENT','LABS') | NOT-SUPPORTED (no room rows) | NOT-SUPPORTED | SUPPORTED (AREA, MAJOR_USE_DESC columns; hint mapping) | SUPPORTED structurally but single-period coverage → VIOLATES | FAC_ROOMS lacks FCLT join key per hints |\n| Running sum of ASSIGNABLE_AREA within CAMPUS_SECTOR per fiscal period | NOT-SUPPORTED (no period grain) | SUPPORTED (ASSIGNABLE_AREA per period; CAMPUS_SECTOR available on FCLT_BUILDING per hint) | NOT-SUPPORTED | NOT-SUPPORTED | NOT-SUPPORTED (sq ft) |\n| EXT_GROSS_AREA output | SUPPORTED (hint maps external gross area → FCLT_BUILDING.EXT_GROSS_AREA) | has column but hint explicitly maps to FCLT_BUILDING | NOT-SUPPORTED | NOT-SUPPORTED | sq-ft variant only |\n| HAVING total room area > 1000 | via join | via join | SUPPORTED (SUM(fr.AREA) > 1000, precedent subquery 1) | — | — |\n\n**3c. Wording-to-Field Anchoring:**\n- \"academic building\" → `FCLT_BUILDING.BUILDING_TYPE = 'ACADEMIC'` (hint column mapping + domain knowledge + column_concept_building_type_site guide).\n- \"at MIT\" → `FCLT_BUILDING.SITE = 'MIT'` (domain knowledge).\n- \"owned by MIT\" → `FCLT_BUILDING.OWNERSHIP_TYPE = 'OWNED'` (hint maps both OWNERSHIP_TYPE and SITE to this phrase).\n- \"excluding the Stata building\" → `FCLT_BUILDING.FCLT_BUILDING_KEY <> '32'` (domain knowledge: Stata = BUILDING_KEY '32'; FCLT_BUILDING_KEY desc confirms '32' example).\n- \"fiscal period\" → `FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.FISCAL_PERIOD` (hint; only gold table carrying it).\n- \"rooms used for 'RESIDENT' or 'LABS' purposes\" → `FCLT_ROOMS.MAJOR_USE_DESC IN ('RESIDENT','LABS')` (hint; FCLT_MAJOR_USE desc confirms these are major-use descriptions).\n- \"total room area greater than 1000\" → `HAVING SUM(FCLT_ROOMS.AREA) > 1000` at building level (hint maps to FCLT_ROOMS.AREA; precedent subquery 1).\n- \"assignable area\" (running sum) → `FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.ASSIGNABLE_AREA` (hint; column_concept_assignable_area guide for history-based statistics).\n- \"campus sector\" (partition) → `FCLT_BUILDING.CAMPUS_SECTOR` (hint).\n- \"external gross area\" → `FCLT_BUILDING.EXT_GROSS_AREA` (hint; \"Extended gross area … in square meters\" per column def).\n- \"building name\" → `FCLT_BUILDING.BUILDING_NAME` (hint; canonical base column — not BUILDING_NAME_LONG).\n\n**3d. Precedent Usage Evidence:**\n- FCLT_BUILDING_HIST-based assignable-area statistics precedents: 10 metrics (dw_505, dw_1190, dw_1888, dw_12, dw_76, dw_126, dw_1357, dw_1488, dw_2596, dw_488).\n- FCLT_ROOMS.AREA total-per-building precedents: dw_488 (\"building with the largest total room area\"), dw_1190, dw_1888, dw_1488.\n- Provided subquery decompositions 1–4 are direct same-shape precedents: #1 (room-area sum + HAVING > 1000), #2 (running sum window PARTITION BY CAMPUS_SECTOR ORDER BY FCLT_BUILDING_KEY, FISCAL_PERIOD ROWS UNBOUNDED PRECEDING), #3 (inner CTE joined to FCLT_BUILDING_HIST per fiscal period), #4 (window CTE + EXT_GROSS_AREA join-back).\n\n### 4. Business Usage\nFCLT_BUILDING is the current building dimension used for type/site/ownership filters in all 10 facility metrics; FCLT_BUILDING_HIST supplies per-fiscal-period assignable area and room counts for trend/dispersion analysis; FCLT_ROOMS supplies room-level area and major-use classification for room-area statistics per building. The three join on FCLT_BUILDING_KEY, exactly the join path in the hints.\n\n### 5. Coverage Checklist\n- FCLT_BUILDING — semantic_get ✓, semantic_graph query_neighbors ✓, metrics via concept ✓\n- FCLT_BUILDING_HIST — semantic_get ✓, metrics_by_table ✓ (10 metrics)\n- FCLT_ROOMS — semantic_get ✓, graph (incoming join to FCLT_BUILDING) ✓\n- FCLT_BUILDING_HIST_1, FCLT_ROOMS_HIST, FAC_BUILDING, FAC_ROOMS, BUILDINGS, FCLT_FLOOR(_HIST), FCLT_MAJOR_USE(_HIST), SPACE_DETAIL/SPACE_UNIT/SPACE_USAGE/ZPM_ROOMS_LOAD, FCLT_ORGANIZATION, TIME_MONTH — descriptions retrieved via semantic_search; excluded with reasons (wrong family / wrong granularity / wrong units / no requested columns).\n- column_concept_assignable_area, column_concept_fiscal_period, column_concept_building_type_site — semantic_get ✓ (comparisons + decision guides cited above).\n- concept_building_inventory — semantic_get ✓; concept_room_space_inventory, concept_room_major_use_classification, concept_floor_inventory — descriptions retrieved and used.\n- mysql_query verification — attempted 5 times; all failed with server-side \"Access denied for user 'root'@'localhost'\" (error 1045). Noted explicitly; SQL built strictly from hint gold tables/join keys and semantic definitions.\n\n### 6. Recommendation\n\n**6a. Tables/columns:** FCLT_ROOMS (AREA, MAJOR_USE_DESC, FCLT_BUILDING_KEY), FCLT_BUILDING (BUILDING_NAME, BUILDING_TYPE, SITE, OWNERSHIP_TYPE, CAMPUS_SECTOR, EXT_GROSS_AREA, FCLT_BUILDING_KEY), FCLT_BUILDING_HIST (FISCAL_PERIOD, ASSIGNABLE_AREA, FCLT_BUILDING_KEY) — exactly the hint gold tables and column mapping.\n\n**6b. SQL approach:** (1) inner CTE: join FCLT_ROOMS→FCLT_BUILDING on FCLT_BUILDING_KEY; filter MAJOR_USE_DESC IN ('RESIDENT','LABS'), BUILDING_TYPE='ACADEMIC', SITE='MIT', OWNERSHIP_TYPE='OWNED', FCLT_BUILDING_KEY<>'32'; GROUP BY building key+name; HAVING SUM(AREA)>1000. (2) Join CTE→FCLT_BUILDING (for CAMPUS_SECTOR, EXT_GROSS_AREA)→FCLT_BUILDING_HIST (for FISCAL_PERIOD, ASSIGNABLE_AREA). (3) Window: SUM(ASSIGNABLE_AREA) OVER (PARTITION BY CAMPUS_SECTOR ORDER BY FCLT_BUILDING_KEY, FISCAL_PERIOD ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) — identical to precedent subqueries #2/#4. (4) SELECT exactly: building name, fiscal period, total room area, running assignable area, external gross area; ORDER BY FISCAL_PERIOD, BUILDING_NAME; no rounding. Caveat: FCLT_BUILDING_HIST fans out ×48 periods per building — intended here (\"for each fiscal period\"); total_room_area repeats per period, matching precedent #3.\n\n**6c. Three-perspective reasons:**\n- **Data**: FCLT_ROOMS is the only gold table with room-level AREA + MAJOR_USE_DESC; FCLT_BUILDING_HIST is the only source of FISCAL_PERIOD + per-period ASSIGNABLE_AREA (coverage 201505–201906); FCLT_BUILDING is 1-row-per-building so classification filters and EXT_GROSS_AREA attach without fan-out; join key FCLT_BUILDING_KEY is documented identical across all three (column defs + hint join keys).\n- **Semantic-network**: column_concept_building_type_site decision guide → filter on FCLT_BUILDING for \"academic buildings at MIT\"; column_concept_assignable_area guide → FCLT_BUILDING_HIST.ASSIGNABLE_AREA for history-based sums; column_concept_fiscal_period guide → use the HIST table's own FISCAL_PERIOD as snapshot stamp; concept_building_inventory confirms FCLT_* family join path.\n- **Business**: 10 existing Facility Space Analysis metrics use this exact table trio for MIT academic buildings; provided subquery decompositions #1–#4 are direct precedents for each clause (HAVING>1000, window frame, EXT_GROSS_AREA join-back).\n\n**6d. Alternatives/tie-breakers:** The only ambiguity is whether the running-sum window is computed over the room-area-filtered building set (my choice, following the question's \"considering only buildings with a total room area greater than 1000\" scoping and precedent #3's CTE-then-hist flow) or over all owned MIT academic buildings excluding Stata (precedent #2's population). The question attaches the filter to the building population of the whole report, so the restricted population flows into the window. DB verification was impossible (access denied); this is the only unresolved fact.\n\n",
